        {
          "id": "5d40448d-a8f4-394b-90ea-c934f2fc0d86",
          "content": {
            "id": "5d40448d-a8f4-394b-90ea-c934f2fc0d86",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "A Look at RCI Hospitality Holdings's Valuation Following New York Indictment and Stock Drop",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "If you\u2019re holding RCI Hospitality Holdings (RICK) or considering the stock, what happened this week is hard to ignore. On September 16, the company, along with its CEO and CFO, was hit by a 79-count indictment from the New York Attorney General. The allegations are sweeping: prosecutors claim RCI and several top executives spent more than a decade bribing a state tax auditor in order to evade millions in sales taxes owed on its Manhattan strip clubs. The resulting market reaction was...",
